h2 { font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 8px; } ul { margin: 4px 0 10px; padding-left: 20px; } li { margin-bottom: 3px; }
</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.8 (build 654)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Optimizing media and exporting no longer crash.</b> Since build 635, making optimized media, exporting a movie, a reel or a side-by-side, and packaging a session could quit the app a moment after the progress bar appeared. The progress bar was at fault, not your media, and it is fixed.</li>
<li><b>Opening many movies at once no longer hangs the app</b> (from build 651), and several files opened together become a playlist.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
